{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50870","headline":"省题诗二十一首 元日端门肆赦 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 元日端门肆赦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"史官开圣历，天子御层楼。\n寿[域]（城）南山色，恩波东海流。\n绕栏生杞梓，当槛簇貔貅。\n日月祥光近，山河喜气浮。\n兆人瞻鳯扆，万里御皇猷。\n欲识春生处，鸡竿最上头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50870.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50870","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}